hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19226","Yaqub narrated to us, Ibn Akhi Ibn Shihab narrated to us from his uncle who said: Ubayd Allah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah ibn Masud informed me that Shabl ibn Hamid al-Muzani informed him that Abdullah ibn Malik al-Awsi informed him that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said about the slave girl: If she commits zina then flog her, then if she commits zina then flog her, then if she commits zina then flog her, then if she commits zina then sell her even for a rope. The rope is a cord, on the third or on the fourth."
"19227","Yazid ibn Abd Rabbihi narrated to us, Baqiyyah ibn al-Walid narrated to us, al-Zubaydi narrated to me from al-Zuhri from Ubayd Allah ibn Abdullah that Shibl ibn Khulayd al-Muzani informed him that Abdullah ibn Malik al-Awsi informed him that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said about the slave girl: If she commits zina then flog her, then if she commits zina then flog her, then if she commits zina then flog her, then if she commits zina then sell her even for a rope. The rope is a cord."
